serial:
  port: /dev/ttyUSB0
  baud: 9600

audio:
  mic_device: default
  speaker_device: default

exec_password: "alpha bravo charlie"  # Your spoken confirmation phrase

models:
  whisper: models/whisper-base.en.bin
  llm: models/llama-3.2-1b-q4_k_m.gguf
  piper: models/en_US-lessac-medium.onnx

  Supported Commands
Read-Only (no confirmation)
VOICE COMMAND
ACTION
"What VLAN is port X on?"
Show switchport config
"Is port X up?"
Show interface status
"What's plugged into port X?"
Show MAC address table
"Any errors on port X?"
Show interface counters
Exec Mode (requires password)
VOICE COMMAND
ACTION
"Shut down port X"
Interface shutdown
"Bring up port X"
No shutdown
"Put port X on VLAN Y"
Change access VLAN
"Set description on port X to Y"
Change description
Safety
Exec commands require spoken password confirmation:
You: "Shut down port 24"
Assistant: "I'm about to shut down GigabitEthernet1/0/24. 
            Please say the password to confirm, or say cancel."
You: "Alpha bravo charlie"
Assistant: "Confirmed. Executing now."

